# 8. Payment and order notification rules

## Cash on delivery

The merchant card shows:

```text
Payment: Cash on delivery
Collect: USD [amount] / LBP [amount]
```

The driver receives the amount to collect only after assignment. If a merchant needs to prepare a high-value COD order, use the configured COD risk rule and customer confirmation process.

## Prepaid order

The merchant card shows:

```text
Payment: Paid online
Merchant collection: handled by Alo King/provider settlement
Customer should not be charged again
```

The merchant and driver must never request an extra payment unless Alo King creates and logs an approved adjustment.

## Payment failure

Do not send the order to the merchant as accepted if payment authorization fails. If payment is pending, the customer sees payment pending and the merchant sees no fulfilment order.

## Refund or cancellation

Every cancellation has a typed reason:

```text
customer request
merchant rejection
merchant timeout
item unavailable
payment failure
driver unavailable
operational incident
```

The reason determines customer messaging, refund/credit behavior, merchant metrics, and whether the merchant is temporarily paused.

