# 13. Merchant onboarding before live ordering

Ordering must remain off until the merchant passes:

```text
1. Business identity and role verification
2. Merchant WhatsApp number verified
3. Backup member or operations fallback configured
4. Menu extracted and approved
5. Prices and currency confirmed
6. Opening hours and pause controls tested
7. Order card test completed
8. Portal login tested
9. Accept/reject test completed
10. Customer notification test completed
11. Driver handoff test completed
12. Cancellation and substitution test completed
13. Payment/COD rules configured
14. Support contact confirmed
```

Run a real-looking dry-run order using a test customer and test merchant. It must never touch a real customer or driver.

