# 14. Recommended go-live configurations

## Small merchant with one operator

```text
Primary: operator WhatsApp
Backup: owner phone call
Portal: one tablet/browser
Acceptance SLA: 120 seconds
Operations call: T+180 seconds
```

## Medium restaurant

```text
Primary: kitchen WhatsApp
Backup: manager WhatsApp
Portal: kitchen tablet + manager browser
Acceptance SLA: 90 seconds
Operations call: T+180 seconds
```

## High-volume restaurant

```text
Primary: portal/KDS
Secondary: merchant WhatsApp
Backup: manager WhatsApp
Alo King operations escalation
Acceptance SLA: 60–90 seconds
Capacity controls and automatic pause
```

## Bakery or small village merchant

```text
Primary: WhatsApp
Backup: owner phone call
Longer acceptance SLA configured per opening hours
Scheduled orders preferred
Manual operations support during soft launch
```

